{"id":"vod_lz_30399","vodId":"30399","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"火影忍者：博人传之次世代继承者","name_cn":"火影忍者：博人传之次世代继承者","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第293集","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220813-1/7ab5a5d7e8c65940877b06376f9d2d94.jpg"},"summary":"随着和平的到来而走向近代化的木叶忍者村。高楼林立，巨大显示屏中播放出影像，连结各区域的电车在村里奔驰。虽说是忍者村，但一般民众也增多，忍者的生存方式也在逐渐改变的这个时代——　　村子的领袖，第七代火影·漩涡鸣人的儿子慕留人，进入了培育忍者的学校“忍者学校”。周围的学生们带着“火影的儿子”这样偏见的目光看待慕留人，但慕留人凭借天生的破天荒性格将这种小事轻松越过！　　慕留人与新的伙伴相遇，他将如何挑战突然发生的神秘事件？　　在众人心中如疾风般狂奔的“漩涡慕留人”的物语，现在开始！！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-07-23 19:02:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":293,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7873_9b0b5205/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7874_caf77ed6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7876_3dd81938/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7875_69ba3582/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7879_a40a495a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7877_47207cde/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7878_5aa9e1f8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7880_3d14aa8a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7881_1681d826/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7882_868e1675/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7883_9e593e17/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7884_7cfdc7e3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7886_d8d9d859/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.com/20220812/7885_756767bf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn14.c